[NAME]
autwords \\- enumerate lasso-shaped words accepted by omega-automata

[DESCRIPTION]
autwords reads omega-automata and enumerates
accepted words that have a lasso shape: a finite stem followed
by a finite cycle that repeats forever.
The lengths of the stem and cycle can be bounded using the
\fB\-\-stem\fR and \fB\-\-cycle\fR options.

[SEE ALSO]
.BR ltl2tgba (1),
.BR autfilt (1),
.BR autdo (1),
